    <string name="segment_candidate_help_title">Editing conversion segments</string>
    <string name="segment_candidate_help">Select a colored segment, then drag its boundary handles. The solid colored band marks the selected reading; the dashed line shows the adjustable range. Long-press a segment and drop it onto another segment to reorder it. Tap a candidate or a tree branch to replace a segment without committing. Use the confirm key to commit. The Tree button opens full-sentence alternatives above the candidate strip.</string>
